<title>UK: BoE to issue 100 mln stg tranche of gilts due 2006.</title>
<headline>BoE to issue 100 mln stg tranche of gilts due 2006.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK is issuing 100 million stg in tranches of existing bonds, to be available for sale from 1045 GMT, the Bank of England said.</p>
<p>The bonds are 100 million stg of the 7.75 percent Treasury stock due 2006.</p>
<p>The Bank said the stock has been created for market management purposes to assist orderly trading in repo transactions in the stock.</p>
<p>-- Mike Peacock, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
